    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the Dalruan Online!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAn Adventure of Realms and Monsters. <br />\r\nSingle Player or with up to 4 players in Epic Online Co-op!<br />\r\nGather Elemental Ore and Protect the realm from the Darkness and his Evil Servants - The Elemental Dragons!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChoose between a Male or Female Protagonist.<br />\r\nAction Combat.<br />\r\nCollect Herbs, Key Items and Quest Items.<br />\r\nMine many Different types of Ore and Merge them into Stronger Variations.<br />\r\nCraft different Weapons, Helmets, Armor, Shields and Rings.<br />\r\nSelect from 8 Different Elements (Fire, Ice, Lightning, Earth, Poison, Dark, Undead and Holy).<br />\r\nEpic boss battles. Navigate horrid caves, dungeons and ruins in Single Player or With Friends!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJoin the ever advancing Realm of Dalruan.",
